<p class="page-intro">Registra el acto que otorga tus horas. Talento Humano debe validarlo antes de que puedas utilizar su saldo.</p>
<div class="detail-columns"><section class="panel"><div class="panel-header"><h2><?=hasRole($u,'admin')?'Actos registrados':'Mis actos administrativos'?></h2></div><?php $acts=hasRole($u,'admin')?rows('SELECT a.*,u.name FROM acts a JOIN users u ON u.id=a.user_id ORDER BY a.id DESC LIMIT 200'):rows('SELECT a.*,u.name FROM acts a JOIN users u ON u.id=a.user_id WHERE a.user_id=? ORDER BY a.id DESC',[$u['id']]); if(!$acts): ?><div class="empty"><?=icon('clock')?><h3>Aún no hay actos registrados</h3><p>Adjunta tu acto e indica las horas otorgadas y su vencimiento.</p></div><?php endif; foreach($acts as $a): $balance=$wf->available($a); ?><article class="act-card"><div class="panel-header flush"><div><h3><?=e($a['number'])?></h3><p><?=e($a['name'])?></p></div><?=badge($a['status'])?></div><div class="act-numbers"><div><span>Reconocidas</span><strong><?=e(hours((int)$a['granted_minutes']))?></strong></div><div><span>Sin asignar</span><strong><?=e(hours($balance))?></strong></div></div><p class="fine">Expedición: <?=e($a['issued_on'])?> · Vencimiento: <?=e($a['expires_on'])?> <?=$a['expires_on']<date('Y-m-d')?' · Vencido; saldo no utilizable':''?></p><?php foreach(rows('SELECT * FROM attachments WHERE act_id=?',[$a['id']]) as $file): ?><a class="text-link" href="/?page=download&id=<?=(int)$file['id']?>"><?=e($file['original_name'])?> ↓</a><?php endforeach; if($a['comment']): ?><p><?=e($a['comment'])?></p><?php endif; if(hasRole($u,'admin') && $a['status']==='pending' && (int)$a['user_id']!==(int)$u['id']): ?><form method="post" class="review-act"><?=csrf()?><input type="hidden" name="action" value="review_act"><input type="hidden" name="id" value="<?=(int)$a['id']?>"><label>Observación de validación<textarea name="comment" required minlength="5" maxlength="3000"></textarea></label><button class="button small" name="decision" value="approved">Validar acto</button><button class="button secondary small" name="decision" value="rejected">Rechazar acto</button></form><?php endif; ?></article><?php endforeach; ?></section>
<aside class="panel form-panel"><h2>Registrar acto administrativo</h2><form method="post" enctype="multipart/form-data"><?=csrf()?><input type="hidden" name="action" value="act"><label>Número de acto o resolución *<input name="number" required maxlength="120"></label><label>Fecha de expedición *<input name="issued_on" type="date" max="<?=date('Y-m-d')?>" required></label><label>Fecha de vencimiento *<input name="expires_on" type="date" min="<?=date('Y-m-d')?>" required></label><label>Total de horas otorgadas *<input name="hours" type="number" min="0.05" step="0.05" required><small>Por ejemplo: 8,5 horas equivalen a un día de jornada ordinaria.</small></label><label>Soporte del acto *<input name="supports[]" type="file" accept=".pdf,.jpg,.jpeg,.png" multiple required></label><button class="button full">Enviar a validación</button></form><p class="fine">El saldo vence en la fecha indicada. Reservar horas no permite disfrutarlas después del vencimiento.</p></aside></div>
